  <diagram name="Page-1" id="hWWKOgkQUGns5Pwrqnfp">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1413" dy="912" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam roundcorner 8\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Segoe UI\&quot;\nskinparam defaultFontSize 11\n\ntitle &lt;size:16&gt;&lt;b&gt;FixMyStreet — Class-Responsibility-Collaborator (CRC) Cards&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/size&gt;\\n\n\nskinparam class {\n    HeaderBackgroundColor #2C3E50\n    BorderColor #2C3E50\n    ArrowColor #2C3E50\n    FontColor white\n    FontSize 12\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\n&#39; ================= CRC CARD 1 =================\nclass \&quot;CRC Card: Citizen\&quot; as CRC1 &lt;&lt; (C,#2980B9) &gt;&gt; #EBF5FB {\n  &lt;color:#1A5276&gt;&lt;b&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt; | &lt;color:#1A5276&gt;&lt;b&gt;Collaborators&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt;\n  --\n  • Register and log in to the system | Authentication System\n  • Submit complaint with photo, location, urgency | Complaint\n  • Track complaint real-time status | Complaint\n  • Provide rating and feedback on resolution | Feedback\n  • Reopen unresolved or poorly fixed issues | Complaint\n}\n\n&#39; ================= CRC CARD 2 =================\nclass \&quot;CRC Card: Complaint\&quot; as CRC2 &lt;&lt; (C,#D4AC0D) &gt;&gt; #FEFDE8 {\n  &lt;color:#7D6608&gt;&lt;b&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt; | &lt;color:#7D6608&gt;&lt;b&gt;Collaborators&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt;\n  --\n  • Store issue details (category, photo, GPS, urgency) | Citizen\n  • Store auto-assigned priority (P1-P4) &amp; SLA deadline | System Rules Engine\n  • Maintain status progression (Submitted -&gt; Closed) | Dept Officer, Field Worker\n  • Record status change history with timestamps | Notification Service\n  • Link assigned department and field technician | Department, Field Worker\n  • Store resolution proof photo | Field Worker\n}\n\n&#39; ================= CRC CARD 3 =================\nclass \&quot;CRC Card: Department Officer\&quot; as CRC3 &lt;&lt; (C,#C0392B) &gt;&gt; #FDEDEC {\n  &lt;color:#78281F&gt;&lt;b&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt; | &lt;color:#78281F&gt;&lt;b&gt;Collaborators&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt;\n  --\n  • Review incoming queue sorted by priority (P1 first) | Complaint\n  • Validate issue legitimacy and jurisdiction | Complaint\n  • Assign field worker to complaint | Field Worker, Complaint\n  • Set expected resolution deadline within SLA | Complaint\n  • Identify and merge duplicate complaints | Complaint\n}\n\n&#39; ================= CRC CARD 4 =================\nclass \&quot;CRC Card: Field Worker\&quot; as CRC4 &lt;&lt; (C,#8E44AD) &gt;&gt; #F4ECF7 {\n  &lt;color:#512E5F&gt;&lt;b&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt; | &lt;color:#512E5F&gt;&lt;b&gt;Collaborators&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt;\n  --\n  • View assigned work orders ranked by priority | Complaint\n  • Navigate to physical issue location via GPS | Map Service\n  • Update task state to \&quot;In Progress\&quot; | Complaint\n  • Upload &#39;After&#39; photo resolution proof | Complaint\n  • Mark work order as \&quot;Resolved\&quot; | Complaint\n}\n\n&#39; ================= CRC CARD 5 =================\nclass \&quot;CRC Card: Feedback\&quot; as CRC5 &lt;&lt; (C,#27AE60) &gt;&gt; #EAFAF1 {\n  &lt;color:#145A32&gt;&lt;b&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt; | &lt;color:#145A32&gt;&lt;b&gt;Collaborators&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt;\n  --\n  • Store citizen rating score (1 to 5 stars) | Citizen, Complaint\n  • Store critique and verification comments | Citizen\n  • Trigger transition: Confirm resolution (Closed) | Complaint\n  • Trigger transition: Dispute resolution (Reopened) | Complaint\n  • Feed satisfaction metrics into department KPIs | System Admin Analytics\n}\n\n&#39; Layout positioning\nCRC1 -[hidden]right- CRC2\nCRC2 -[hidden]right- CRC3\nCRC1 -[hidden]down- CRC4\nCRC4 -[hidden]right- CRC5\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="9QU13PjBE_a7U-jY-gem-1">
